\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 2. (310r-468v) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Plato, \plain \f1\fs24 Phaedrus - \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Hermias Alexandrinus, \plain \f1\fs24 In Platonis Phaedrum commentarius (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8057 ?\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u934 \'d6\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 ), ed. pr. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Fr.\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ast\plain \f1\fs24 , Platonis Phaedrus. Recensuit Hermiae scholiis e cod. Monac. XI ..., Leipzig 1810, S. 59-204, anhand dieses Ms.; ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Couvreur\plain \f1\fs24 , 1901 (s. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\fs24 ), S. 1-266. In beiden Ausgaben nur der Kommentar ediert. - Plato-Text und Kommentar intermittierend; ersterer durch marginale Anf\u252 \'fchrungszeichen markiert. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 310r-316r) Prooemium commentarii. - (313v-314v) Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u8057 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?.\plain \f1\fs24 -(314v-316r) Dialogi vera intentio (Ms. ohne Titel; Text auf der 3. Z. v. u. direkt an das Prooemium anschlie\u223 \'dfend). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (316r-360v) Pars I, Plat. 227a1-244a3 (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u969 \'f9\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2, \u934 \'d6\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u7970 ? \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ).Nach 227a1-3 auf f. 316r: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u8166 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed \u7969 ? \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u8165 ?\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u8053 ?\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8057 ?\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\fs24 . Auf f. 353r, 5. Z. v. u. bis 353v, Z. 4 Textzusatz gegen\u252 \'fcber \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Couvreur \plain \f1\fs24 (s. S. 70 app. crit.). - (361r-412v) Pars II, Plat. 243a3-249d3 (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8057 ?\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u934 \'d6\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed, \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ? \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 ). - (412v-468v) Pars III, Plat. 249d4-279c8 (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u917 \'c5\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 ..., \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ? \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 ).}

