\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 (1r-171v) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Basilius Caesariensis, \plain \f1\fs24 Enarratio in Isaiam*: Sermones 1-19 (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u960 \'f0\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u7953 ?\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8053 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u8147 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 30, 117-668; ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 P. Trevisan, \plain \f1\fs24 San Basilio. Commento al profeta Isaia I-II, [Corona patrum Salesiana, Ser. Gr. 4-5.] Turin 1939; CPG 2911; CPG Suppl. 2911. - Weder Z\u228 \'e4hlung der Sermones noch Kapiteleinteilung. Die Initien der Sermones, jeweils Isaias-Text, in Rot. 
