280-400 = ed. pr. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 J. Hergenr\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ther,\plain \f1\fs24 Photii patriarchae liber de Spiritus Sancti mystagogia ..., Regensburg 1857, auch anhand dieses Ms. - Im Freirand springende Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?-\u955 \'eb\u947 \'e3\u884 ?.\plain \f1\fs24 - Text unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 . PG 102, 345B \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u967 \'f7\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u7953 ?\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2 \plain \f1\fs24 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 ed\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ...; dazu im Freirand vom "Korrektor A": \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 . }

