\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 6. (288v-324r) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 <Georgius Moschampar>, \plain \f1\fs24 Disputatio inter Georgium Moschampar et Beccianum sequentem Latinorum partes de processione Spiritus Sancti (Ms. ohne Titel); vgl. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 V. Laurent\plain \f1\fs24 , in: Echos d\u180 \'b4Orient 35 (1936), S. 344. Als Werk des \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Maximus Margunius \plain \f1\fs24 ed. <\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 N. Metaxas\plain \f1\fs24 >, \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u958 \'ee\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u952 \'e8\u8053 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2, \plain \f1\fs24 ohne Ort und Jahr (wohl London 1624; vgl. G. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Podskalsky, \plain \f1\fs24 Griechische Theologie in der Zeit der T\u252 \'fcrkenherrschaft 1453-1821, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1988, Anm. 225 und 599), S. 7-75. - Im Ms. wie in der Ausgabe folgen dem Prooemium (mit dem integrierten Traktat) nur die ersten 20 Kapitel des Werkes. Kapitelgliederung mit entsprechenden \u220 \'dcberschriften sowie Z\u228 \'e4hlung beginnen erst mit \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6. \u949 \'e5\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 (ab f. 295r). - Im Freirand die Dialogredner \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u966 \'f6\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 und \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2 \plain \f1\fs24 (oder \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u949 \'e5\u8061 ?\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 ) angezeigt mit den Siglen \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 /\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2 \plain \f1\fs24 bzw. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ; vgl. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 V. Laurent - J. Darrouz\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u232 \'e8\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 s, \plain \f1\fs24 Dossier grec de l\u180 \'b4Union de Lyon (1273-1277), [Archives de l\u180 \'b4Orient Chr\u233 \'e9tien, 16.] Paris 1976, S. 22 Anm. 1. - (288v-290r) Prooemium; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 .(\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 /\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8054 ? \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u8055 ?\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5 \u7936 ?\u966 \'f6\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u959 \'ef\u8016 ? \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u947 \'e3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5 \u8033 ?\u962 \'f2 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 . (\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u927 \'cf\u960 \'f0\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8049 ? \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7972 ?\u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8033 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u8150 ? \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\fs24 - (290r, 13. Z. v. u. - 292v, Z. 9) Tractatus de schismate Ecclesiarum (Ms. ohne Titel; im Prooemium integriert), ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hergenr\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ther, \plain \f1\fs24 1869 (s. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\fs24 ), S. 171-181, auch anhand dieses Ms.; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u954 \'ea\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u8000 ?\u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8053 ?\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7940 ?\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2 \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u8190 ?\u929 \'d1\u8061 ?\u956 \'ec\u8131 ? \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed \u7956 ?\u954 \'ea\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\fs24 - (292v-293v) Prooemium (Fortsetzung); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . (\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 /\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u884 ? \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u922 \'ca\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u924 \'cc\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u8052 ?\u955 \'eb \u8021 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u8004 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 .(\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 /\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\u8016 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8058 ? \u948 \'e4\u8051 ? \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\fs24 - (293v-308r) Kap.\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . (\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8056 ? \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u945 \'e1\u7988 ?\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u7984 ?\u948 \'e4\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1 \u949 \'e5\u7990 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8051 ? \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 . (\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 /\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u7940 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u948 \'e4\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\fs24 Auf f. 296v im Freirand (zu \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Metaxas,\plain \f1\fs24 S. 22,20 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u8179 ? \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u950 \'e6\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\fs24 ) schematische Darstellung des Verh\u228 \'e4ltnisses der drei g\u246 \'f6ttlichen Personen zueinander. - (308r-324r) Kap.\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u884 ?-\u954 \'ea\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . (\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u954 \'ea \u7956 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u954 \'ea \u7956 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \u8038 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8023 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 . (\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7936 ?\u958 \'ee\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u967 \'f7\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ? \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u965 \'f5\u7985 ?\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u965 \'f5\u7984 ?\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\fs24 Auf f. 322v, 7. Z. v. u. Textsprung gegen\u252 \'fcber \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Metaxas\plain \f1\fs24 , S. 71,7 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ? \u7941 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u8021 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 ... 73,8 (Kap. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u952 \'e8\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 ) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u7953 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\fs24 . - Am Ende Zeichnung einer Kolumne (unter dem Titel \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u