\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 2. (216r-369r) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Antiochus Sancti Sabae,\plain \f1\fs24 Pandecta, PG 89, 1428-1849; CPG 7843. - (216r-217r) Prologus (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 ), PG 89, 1428-1429. - (217r-218v) Index 130 capitulorum pandectae (Ms.\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u952 \'e8\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1 \u961 \'f1\u955 \'eb\u884 ?\u903 ? \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8052 ? \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 ); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 .\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ? \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7972 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2. \plain \f1\fs24 Alles in Rot. Auf ff. 217v und 218v die \u220 \'dcberschriften z. T. in zwei Spalten. Z\u228 \'e4hlung \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u955 \'eb\u884 ? \plain \f1\fs24 (Kap. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \plain \f1\fs24 ohne Zahl; vgl. unten). - (219r-230r) Kap. 1-10 (Z\u228 \'e4hlung nach PG). - (230v-242r) Kap. 11-20. - (242v-256v) Kap. 21-30. - (256v-263v) Kap. 31-38.- (264r-266r) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u952 \'e8\u884 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 = Kap. 40-41. - (266r-285v) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 = Kap. 42-61. - (286r-294v) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 = Kap. 62-71. - (295r-305v) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u951 \'e7\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 = Kap. 72-79. - (306r-v) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u884 ?\plain \f1\fs24 = Kap. 39. - (307r-320v) Kap. 80-90. - (320v-329v) Kap. 91-100. - (330r-343r) Kap. 101-110. - (343v-355v) Kap. 111-120. - (356r-369r) Kap. 121-130. Das letzte Kap. unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des. mut\plain \f1\fs24 . PG 89, 1845C \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7985 ?\u961 \'f1\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \plain \f1\fs24 (dazu vom Schreiber: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\fs24 ). Fernerfehlt Kap. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 (PG 89, 1849-1856). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zahlen in den \u220 \'dcberschriften bisweilen ausgelassen. \u220 \'dcberschriften gegen\u252 \'fcber der PG h\u228 \'e4ufig verk\u252 \'fcrzt, jedoch identisch mit dem Index.}

