\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 1. (416r-428v) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Georgius Pletho, \plain \f1\fs24 Ex Appiani historiae Romanae libro XI (historia Syriaca) epitoma (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u954 \'ea \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u960 \'f0\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u7985 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \u931 \'d3\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 K. Brodersen\plain \f1\fs24 , Appians Antiochike (Syriake 1,1-44,232). Text und Kommentar nebst einem Anhang: Plethons Syriake-Exzerpt, [M\u252 \'fcnchener Arb. z. Alten Gesch., 3.] M\u252 \'fcnchen 1991, S. 53-68; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7974 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des. mut\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u956 \'ec\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2, \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u948 \'e4\u8051 ? \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1 \u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8053 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 . - Verk\u252 \'fcrzende Paraphrase.Im oberen Freirand in Rot: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\u952 \'e8\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 . }

