\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 2. (430r-439r) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 Georgius Pletho, \plain \f1\fs24 E Strabonis Geographicorum libris IX-X (Ms. ohne Titel). - (430r-436v) Ex lib. IX, vgl. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 A. Meineke, \plain \f1\fs24 Strabonis Geographica II, Leipzig 1853, S. 606,15-626; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7 \u967 \'f7\u8061 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u8005 ?\u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u8057 ?\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed. \plain \f1\fs24 Zahlreiche Textauslassungen. - (436v-439r) Ex lib. X (direkt an das Vorhergehende anschlie\u223 \'dfend), ed\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 . G. G. Bredow, \plain \f1\fs24 Epistolae Parisienses, Leipzig 1812, S. 92-98. Strabo-Text nur bis f. 437r, Z. 4 (= \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Meineke, \plain \f1\fs24 S. 627,20); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8190 ?\u919 \'c7 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ? \u917 \'c5\u8020 ?\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8048 ? \u960 \'f0\u8118 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ? \u8142 ?\u917 \'c5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u8142 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2.\plain \f1\fs24 - Der Rest (im unmittelbaren Anschlu\u223 \'df) ist eine Kompilation Plethos aus Elementen von Strabo-, Ptolemaeus- und Plutarchus-Texten, vgl. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Diller \plain \f1\fs24 (s. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\fs24 )\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\fs24 S. 35; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8142 ?\u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2] \u965 \'f5\u7985 ?\u8051 ?\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2, \u8003 ?\u962 \'f2 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u7940 ?\u961 \'f1\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2 ... \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u8061 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u8054 ? \u920 \'c8\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 \u8100 ?\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\fs24 . - Im oberen Freirand in Rot: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1 \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u952 \'e8\u8061 ?\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1. \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u931 \'d3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u946 \'e2\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 . }

