\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f2\fs24 (pp. 1-6. 6A-6B [leer]. 7-18. 18A-18B [leer]. 19-21. 21A-21B. 22-23) <Marcus von Peutinger>, Index initiorum epistularum Isidori Pelusiotae (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8142 ?\u917 \'c5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u7936 ?\u955 \'eb\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u8127 ?\u921 \'c9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u8061 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u928 \'d0\u951 \'e7\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u7953 ?\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f2\fs24 ). - (pp. 24-38) Leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Bis zum Brief \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u955 \'eb\u884 ? \u923 \'cb\u8051 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f2\fs24 (f. 65v). Die Initien sind nach den Anfangsbuchstaben alphabetisch geordnet. In einer Parallelspalte Briefnummer und Adressatenname;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f2\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u913 \'c1\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\u962 \'f2 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\plain \f2\fs24 <\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f2\fs24 >\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u903 ? \u957 \'ed\u950 \'e6\u884 ?. \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8179 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f2\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8158 ?\u937 \'d9\u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u954 \'ea\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\u903 ? \u961 \'f1\u960 \'f0\u951 \'e7\u884 ?. \u923 \'cb\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u8179 ?. \plain \f2\fs24 Die Angabe von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hardt \plain \f2\fs24 I, S. 248, das Initienverzeichnis stamme von J. Gretser, ist irrig; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tiftixoglu\plain \f2\fs24 , S. 136.}

