\pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\fs24 3. (102v-111r) \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius Cyprius patr. CP, \plain \f1\fs24 Epistulae (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u915 \'c3\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 S. Eustratiades, \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u959 \'ef\u7984 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u915 \'c3\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\plain \f1\fs24 , in:\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u8127 ?\u917 \'c5\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u934 \'d6\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \plain \f1\fs24 1-5, Kairo 1908-10; vgl. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 V. Laurent\plain \f1\fs24 , Les regestes des actes du patriarcat de Constantinople. Vol. I: Les actes des patriarches; fascicule 4: Les regestes de 1208 \u224 \'e0 1309, Paris 1971. - Sammlung von 24 Briefen; darunter Epist. 116 und 118 von \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24  Theodorus Muzalon \plain \f1\fs24 (genannt \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\fs24 ), an Gregorius Cyprius gerichtet. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (102v-107r) Epist. 115 (\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Laurent, \plain \f1\fs24 Reg. 1\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 519), \plain \f1\fs24 116, 117 (\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Laurent, \plain \f1\fs24 Reg. 1520), 118-119, 33, 55, 69, 78, 80 (Z\u228 \'e4hlung nach \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Eustratiades\plain \f1\fs24 ). - (107r-110r) Epist. 45, 73, 56, 12, 195, 15-16, 22, 25, 30. - (110r-111r) Epist. 101, 51, 61, 67. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx570\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vom Schreiber weder Z\u228 \'e4hlung noch Angabe von Adressaten. Im Freirand von Hardt arab. Z\u228 \'e4hlung 1-24 und Eintragung der Adressatennamen (anhand von \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lambeck - Kollar \plain \f1\fs24 VIII [s. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\fs24 ], S. 1066-1090).}

